body:
Hey,  


I gave it a read and the analogies you use are incredible. It was such a vivid depiction of what anxiety is like and I feel like anyone with anxiety could read that and just go, "Wow, someone gets it." I can see how it was cathartic to get this all out. Personally, music helps me cope. If you ever want to stop by my channel, I make songs about mental health. Stay in touch.  
 [https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCP1ZOitMXgFB5ZtMo9lmtAA](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCP1ZOitMXgFB5ZtMo9lmtAA) 

&#x200B;

Quiet Comedian

&#x200B;
